    <briefdescription>
<para>FilePermssionsApplier helps to copy permissions from an input file to an output one. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It memorizes the status of the input file and can apply permissions and dates to the output file. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
